B%5D%2C%22foldLines%22%3A%5B%5D%2C%22theme%22%3A%22default%22%2C%22id%22%3A%22fTnbC%22%7D\"></card><p data-lake-id=\"ubc58f9bc\" id=\"ubc58f9bc\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"uf7bcdd80\" id=\"uf7bcdd80\">好处</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uc8173c5e\" id=\"uc8173c5e\">：</span></p><ul list=\"ueb1dfb09\"><li fid=\"u25031542\" data-lake-id=\"u2a983f0d\" id=\"u2a983f0d\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u4e42bf60\" id=\"u4e42bf60\">自动并行</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u8fbe0f5f\" id=\"u8fbe0f5f\">：开发者不用思考&quot;哪些可以并发&quot;</span></li><li fid=\"u25031542\" data-lake-id=\"u4310fe9e\" id=\"u4310fe9e\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"u66090434\" id=\"u66090434\">延迟下界</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"uff04f5d3\" id=\"uff04f5d3\">：wall-clock = sum(各层最长节点) 而非 sum(全部节点)</span></li><li fid=\"u25031542\" data-lake-id=\"ua3946952\" id=\"ua3946952\"><strong><span data-lake-id=\"udf30ed9d\" id=\"udf30ed9d\">简单确定</span></strong><span data-lake-id=\"u5ccae63d\" id=\"u5ccae63d\">：一层完成才进下一层，状态清晰</span></li></ul><h4 data-lake-id=\"yhYFL\" id=\"yhYFL\"><br></h4>",
